    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag &amp; Toll Documentation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the vehicle’s FASTag is active, linked to a prepaid account, and correctly affixed on the windshield. Record the tag number and keep a digital copy of the balance screenshot. For bike shifting in train corridors that involve road legs, FASTag readiness avoids delays at toll plazas.</p>
